[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0771","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0771.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0517","title":"HP-UX SNMP 默认团体字符串信息泄露漏洞","description":"HP-UX 系统上的 SNMP 服务使用了默认、为空或缺失的团体名（如常见的 \"public\"），导致攻击者无需有效凭证即可访问 SNMP 代理。该漏洞影响启用了 SNMP 服务且未修改默认配置的 HP-UX 主机，攻击条件为攻击者能通过网络访问目标主机的 UDP 161 端口。利用方式是通过发送带有默认团体名的 SNMP 请求，读取系统信息、网络配置、用户账户等敏感数据，可能造成信息泄露，CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级为中。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0517"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:33Z","remediation":"修改 SNMP community name 为复杂强密码，禁止使用默认值 public 或空字符串；如业务无需 SNMP 服务，直接禁用或卸载相关 SNMP 代理进程；在网络层面通过防火墙或 ACL 限制 UDP 161 端口的访问源，仅允许受信任的管理主机访问；升级至操作系统厂商发布的安全补丁版本，确保 SNMP 配置符合最小权限原则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0517","https://www.broadcom.com/support/fibre-channel-networking/security-advisories/brocade-security-advisory-2017-244","https://www.broadcom.com/support/fibre-channel-networking/security-advisories/brocade-security-advisory-2017-244/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0517.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10323cb4135457b41074412d623aa2116c4e1200/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0517.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0517","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/0e18153fbb4123e7b766fcd8c28227fcde5a3816/1999/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5a9570703da14a2b5eac448afa9c83878dd7f663/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0517.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/968abdc74763b43a3cdd216fbb1950cab484f982/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/cd275183e69131386d0c86c5a1716b6a67ff7687/references/CVE-1999-0517-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0517.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdec8f567bb266b7b6813bda45223a258023f538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wvmj-jgmg-4ghq/GHSA-wvmj-jgmg-4ghq.json","https://github.com/jacobdjwilson/awesome-annual-security-reports/blob/f0f80f6f91645a9b6c6e9d7233a009a7ac3a809a/Markdown%20Conversions/2025/Edgescan-Vulnerability-Statistics-Report-2025.md","https://github.com/ialejandrozalles/InvestigacionAplicacionCVE-1999-0517"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0771.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0765","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0765.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0511","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 和 Windows 2000 IP 转发默认启用信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows NT 和 Windows 2000 系统默认或错误配置启用了 IP 转发功能，导致非路由器或防火墙的普通主机充当网络层转发节点。远程攻击者可利用此配置缺陷，通过该主机转发数据包绕过网络访问控制策略，实现内网探测、中间人攻击或信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 系统，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。修复建议为在非路由场景下禁用 IP 转发功能。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0511"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:33Z","remediation":"在非路由器的 Windows NT/2000 系统上，通过注册表将 `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Tcpip\\Parameters\\IPEnableRouter` 值设为 0，或通过网络连接属性取消勾选「启用 IP 转发」。同时建议升级至 Windows Server 2003 或更高版本以获得更完善的安全机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0511","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0511.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2f8583cd0e244c401900c481a78c07fe5535c09f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0511.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0511","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5a9570703da14a2b5eac448afa9c83878dd7f663/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0511.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0511.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/78eafd4564fbf54df959d50d6817c30fd8606422/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3fwm-5x3q-64xf/GHSA-3fwm-5x3q-64xf.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e2d061a60b9c6823d20cc72e51f709fadad54d2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0511.json","https://github.com/Hurley2017/mulval_updated/blob/eeb3da1975075e62db42cbfde5b4a8a3e9f35654/CustomTests/HomeWiFi/vulInfo.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83204/info.html","https://github.com/hadousoftware/base-images/blob/ab6afc9661bbd001d8be8fdc4ac1a3fdd8d1e824/base/abi/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0765.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0764","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0764.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0510","title":"路由器或防火墙 IP源路由绕过漏洞","description":"IP 源路由选项（Loose Source and Record Route / Strict Source Routing）允许数据包发送方指定途经路径。当路由器或防火墙未正确过滤携带源路由选项的 IP 数据包时，远程攻击者可绕过正常的路由策略和访问控制规则，伪造可信源地址，将数据包强制路由至本不可达的内部网络，进而实施网络探测、中间人攻击或越权访问。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS v2.0 评分 7.5，危害等级高。缓解措施包括在网络边界设备上禁用 IP 源路由选项的转发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0510"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:32Z","remediation":"在路由器或防火墙上禁用 IP 源路由功能：Cisco 设备使用 `no ip source-route` 命令，Linux 系统设置 `net.ipv4.conf.all.accept_source_route=0`，Windows 系统将注册表 `HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\Tcpip\\Parameters\\DisableIPSourceRouting` 设为 2。同时确保边界 ACL 过滤源路由选项（IP Option 3）的数据包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0510","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2f8583cd0e244c401900c481a78c07fe5535c09f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0510.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0510","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0510.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e2d061a60b9c6823d20cc72e51f709fadad54d2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0510.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8d306744aeef0a134e581249fd492603b0e6795d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5f97-65cc-4xfc/GHSA-5f97-65cc-4xfc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0510.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83214/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0764.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0754","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0754.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0504","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 本地用户账户默认空密码权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统中存在默认、空值、空白或缺失密码的本地用户或管理员账户漏洞，攻击者可通过枚举或暴力破解等方式利用空密码或默认密码直接登录目标系统，获取系统控制权限。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 系列操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可借助 Metasploit 等工具框架中的认证用户代码执行模块实施远程利用，无需额外认证绕过。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0504"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:32Z","remediation":"为所有 Windows NT 本地用户和管理员账户设置复杂密码（至少 8 位，含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符）。启用本地安全策略中的密码复杂度要求和账户锁定阈值（如 5 次失败即锁定 30 分钟）。通过组策略禁用 Guest 账户，并定期审计所有本地账户密码状态。对于 Windows Server，可在安全模板中启用密码必须满足复杂性要求策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0504","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16374","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea7161c86d011c8f810b70db6eb52fc6fcb9878b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0504.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0504","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/968abdc74763b43a3cdd216fbb1950cab484f982/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0504.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e2d061a60b9c6823d20cc72e51f709fadad54d2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0504.json","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/20991.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ce70cbcf8165046f2229cbe0d9f53c47bf63ece0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4cc2-25hc-9x3v/GHSA-4cc2-25hc-9x3v.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_login_as_users.nasl","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/cve_2_MSF_exploit_Mapping/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/dradis/dradis-nexpose/blob/fe9333a24a7a643ff8ddf64588baac4a9062fc0a/templates/full_vulnerability.sample"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0754.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0753","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0753.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0503","title":"Microsoft Windows NT/2000 账户可猜测密码漏洞","description":"Windows NT 和 Windows 2000 系统中存在用户账户密码强度不足的漏洞，本地用户或管理员账户若设置了弱口令或默认密码，攻击者可通过暴力破解或字典攻击等方���获取系统访问权限。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 等版本，允许已获得本地访问权限的攻击者提升权限或横向移动。建议使用强密码策略并启用账户锁定机制以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0503"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:32Z","remediation":"通过本地安全策略（secpol.msc）启用密码必须符合复杂性要求策略，设置密码长度最小值至少 8 个字符，密码最长使用期限不超过 90 天，并启用账户锁定阈值（5 次无效登录后锁定 30 分钟）。对于已停服的 Windows NT/2000 系统，建议迁移至受支持的 Windows Server 版本并部署 Active Directory 组策略统一实施密码策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ea7161c86d011c8f810b70db6eb52fc6fcb9878b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0503.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0503","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0503.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc69cd1e5221f68ef56bd10c5c61adf76a19f0fc/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0503.json","https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/blob/bbd7116272e853f39577ba54522637fe18ed9411/Sample%20Data/Custom/beSECURE_ScanResults_CL.json","https://github.com/brampat/security/blob/41c178323fcaa886c7e5cea6297a6d2391d35b00/defense/passwords/README.md","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0503.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0753.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0750","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0750.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0499","title":"Microsoft Windows NT/2000 SNMP NetBIOS 共享信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows NT 和 Windows 2000 系统中，NetBIOS 共享信息可能通过 SNMP 注册表项被非授权泄露。远程攻击者可利用 SNMP 服务查询目标系统的注册表，获取 NetBIOS 共享名称、路径等敏感信息，为后续攻击提供侦察基础。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 版本，攻击者只需能够访问目标系统的 SNMP 服务（默认端口 161/162）即可利用，无需身份认证。建议禁用不必要的 SNMP 服务或限制 SNMP 访问权限以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0499"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:31Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows Server 2003 或更高版本系统，或在 SNMP 服务配置中将注册表项 HKLM\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\SNMP\\Parameters 的权限设置为仅允许管理员访问，同时在防火墙上限制 UDP 161/162 端口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0499"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0750.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0564","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0564.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0345","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/NT 4.0 ICMP Jolt 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95 及 Windows NT 4.0 的 ICMP 协议处理存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标系统发送特制的分片 ICMP 数据包（即 Jolt 攻击），触发系统在处理畸形 IP 分片重组时产生资源耗尽或内核崩溃，导致目标系统蓝屏死机或完全停止响应。该漏洞影响 Windows 95 及 Windows NT 4.0 版本，属于经典的 IP 分片攻击方式。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0345"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:11Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-035 提供的补丁，或升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6 及以上版本；Windows 95 用户应安装 Winsock2 更新。如无法打补丁，建议在网络边界防火墙或主机 IPSec 策略中丢弃恶意分片 ICMP 数据包，防止畸形 IP 分片到达目标系统。彻底解决需升级至受支持的 Windows 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/62170","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/77be9686a381151781bc75b69de578b4d9528aae/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0345.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0345","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0345.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ed191c1149de50e461e9a357f4a3a22e603f0d1/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0345.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7a93df7f7051799495805bc211adea8d202dae7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pwf4-g7fv-h2w4/GHSA-pwf4-g7fv-h2w4.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7c1bf0db-8de4-4873-82bc-3461101fb8a2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0345.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0564.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0460","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0460.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0274","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 DNS Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 DNS 服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标服务器发送一个未经请求的恶意 DNS 应答数据包，由于服务器未对该应答与待处理查询进行匹配验证，处理该异常响应时会导致服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，造成正常的域名解析服务中断。攻击者无需认证即可远程触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0274"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:03Z","remediation":"升级 Windows NT 4.0 至 Service Pack 4 及以上版本，或在 DNS 服务器上配置仅响应来自可信上游 DNS 的查询请求，并在边界防火墙上过滤源端口 53 的非授权 DNS 响应数据包，防止伪造 DNS 应答触发拒绝服务。如无法升级，建议将 DNS 服务迁移至 Windows 2000 Server 或后续受支持版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:0