en Enterprise Server (OES) 当前维护版本以获得完整安全支持。如暂无法升级，可在 NetWare 服务器上通过设置 SET ALLOW ICMP REDIRECT = OFF 禁用 ICMP 重定向处理；同时在网络边界防火墙配置规则，丢弃入站的 ICMP 类型 5（重定向）报文，以阻断远程攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ154174","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0265.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0265.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0265","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0265.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0265.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/icmp.rules","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0265.md","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/473.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0265.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.386"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0449.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0438","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0438.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0253","title":"Microsoft IIS 3.0 ASP 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 3.0 在安装 iis-fix 热修复补丁后存在源码泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中使用 %2e 替代点号（.）绕过补丁限制，直接读取 ASP 程序源代码。该漏洞影响 IIS 3.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致数据库连接字符串、业务逻辑等敏感信息泄露，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0253"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 提供的 IIS 3.0 安全补丁 (Q164301)，或升级至 IIS 4.0 及以上版本。如无法升级，可部署 URLScan 工具拦截包含 %2e 的 URL 请求，或在 ISAPI 过滤器中添加规则对 %2e 进行规范化校验，防止编码绕过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1814","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0253.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0253","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0253.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0253.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0253.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jq56-hqwg-c6vv/GHSA-jq56-hqwg-c6vv.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0253.yaml","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/asp_source_dot.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0253.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0438.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0437","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0437.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0252","title":"L-Soft LISTSERV 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags. Let me craft a good Chinese description.<value>LISTSERV 邮件列表管理软件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于程序在处理用户输入（如特定命令参数）时未对数据长度进行充分边界校验，导致超长输入可覆盖内存相邻区域。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向 LISTSERV 服务发送特制构造的恶意命令请求，即可触发缓冲区溢出并覆盖返回地址，进而实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响早期版本 LISTSERV（如 1.8a 等），攻击者可借此完全控制运行该服务的服务器，执行任意系统命令、读取或篡改数据，危害程度较高。修复方式为升级至已修复的 LISTSERV 版本并限制服务网络访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0252"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 LISTSERV 至 1.8c 或更高版本，该版本已修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。无法立即升级时，在防火墙限制对 LISTSERV 端口（如 25/SMTP）的访问，仅允许受信 IP 连接，并监控异常请求以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0252","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0252.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0252.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0252","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0252.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0252.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0252.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0252.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c6cefb8e-0a81-40ca-8e3d-51d21f448702.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0437.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0436","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0436.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0251","title":"Unix Talkd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Talkd（talk守护进程）存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制请求，破坏目标用户的终端显示内容，导致正常会话中断或系统服务异常。该漏洞影响早期Unix/Linux系统中运行的talk服务，攻击者可通过网络连接利用该缺陷进行远程拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0251"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:00Z","remediation":"立即禁用 talkd 服务（`systemctl disable talkd --now` 或 `killall talkd`），并在防火墙层面拦截 UDP/TCP 517 端口（`iptables -A INPUT -p udp --dport 517 -j DROP`）。如业务需要使用 talk 服务，应升级操作系统的 talkd 实现至修复版本或迁移至加密替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0251","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0251.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0251.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0251","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0251.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0251.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4pmp-8rgh-2hrv/GHSA-4pmp-8rgh-2hrv.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0251.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82087/info.html","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/1999/CVE-1999-0251.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0436.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0434","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0434.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0249","title":"Microsoft Windows NT RSHSVC 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows NT 与 Windows 2000 系统中的 RSHSVC（远程 Shell 服务）存在远程代码执行漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该服务缺乏足够访问控制的问题，通过网络连接向目标系统的 RSHSVC 端口发送特制请求，从而以系统权限执行任意命令，实现完全控制目标主机。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 版本，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0249"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:59Z","remediation":"Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 均已生命周期结束，建议立即升级到受支持版本的 Windows（如 Windows Server 2019/2022）以彻底消除该漏洞。如无法升级，可采取缓解措施：通过服务管理器停止 RSHSVC 服务并将启动类型设为\"禁用\"；同时在防火墙层面阻止外部对 TCP 514 等 rsh 相关端口的访问，限制仅授权管理 IP 可访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0249","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0249.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0249.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0249","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0249.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0249.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0249.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0249.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0434.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0421","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0421.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0236","title":"NCSA HTTPd / Apache httpd ScriptAlias 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"NCSA 1.3/1.4.x/1.5 及 Apache HTTPd 0.8.11/0.8.14 的 ScriptAlias 目录配置存在源码泄露漏洞。攻击者可通过直接访问 ScriptAlias 指定目录下的 CGI 程序文件，绕过服务器对脚本的正常执行处理，从而以明文方式读取 CGI 程序的源代码，导致数据库连接凭证、业务逻辑及内部算法等敏感信息暴露。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用此漏洞，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0236"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:58Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Apache HTTPD 2.4.x 或更新版本（NCSA httpd 已停止维护超过 20 年），该漏洞已在 Apache 1.x 后续版本修复。确保 ScriptAlias 目录配置中不包含源文件读取权限，移除不必要的目录映射并限制 CGI 目录的访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0236","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20595","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/1999/CVE-1999-0236.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ead50dc12e50bdd7f50b53d9d01c9f9946862c44/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0236.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0236","https://github.com/kenhuangus/llm-wiki/blob/d2bd485921f6c7b6071afbb389f44ab8e4e83c69/wiki/security/cve/cve-1999-0236.md","https://github.com/Indie365/cbl-mariner/blob/80d864c0a617439675510c037c8a4589aa596fbb/SPECS/httpd/CVE-1999-0236.nopatch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ed191c1149de50e461e9a357f4a3a22e603f0d1/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0236.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b7a93df7f7051799495805bc211adea8d202dae7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xgp2-4cpq-g2m7/GHSA-xgp2-4cpq-g2m7.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0236.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0236.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0421.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0421.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0421.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0389","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0389.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0204","title":"Sendmail 8.6.9 ident 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.6.9 在处理 IDENT 协议查询时存在远程命令执行漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标邮件服务器发送特制的 IDENT 请求触发该漏洞，以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Sendmail 8.6.9 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至最新版本的 Sendmail 以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0204"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:54Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.9.0 或更高版本以彻底修复 IDENT 协议处理缺陷；编辑 sendmail.cf 配置文件，将 timeout.ident 设置为 0 以禁用 IDENT 查询功能；若暂时无法升级，在边界防火墙上拦截入站 TCP 端口 113（IDENT 服务端口）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0204","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20599","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/1999/CVE-1999-0204.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvel